    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27 Spiny &amp; Chilly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spiny &amp; Chilly</strong> is a 3D platformer collectathon inspired by genre classics like <i>Banjo-Kazooie</i>, <i>Super Mario 64</i>, <i>Super Mario Galaxy</i>, and modern hits like <i>A Hat in Time</i>. Take control of <strong>Chilly</strong>, a goofy, ice-obsessed penguin, and his sarcastic hedgehog companion <strong>Spiny</strong>, as they set off on a whimsical journey to recover the stolen ice blocks from the evil Polar Bear King.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant, themed worlds packed with secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master satisfying movement mechanics like wall jumps, double jumps, sliding, and surfing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with gameplay elements like bounce platforms, gravity shifts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect tons of unique items\u2014especially the precious <strong>ice blocks</strong> scattered throughout each level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Worlds to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Spiny &amp; Chilly as they venture through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meteor-crashed valley turned mining colony run by mole engineers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted harbor plagued by ghost ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A floating island inhabited by brilliant bird scientists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is handcrafted with its own theme, challenges, and quirky characters.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27 Spiny &amp; Chilly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spiny &amp; Chilly</strong> is a 3D platformer collectathon inspired by genre classics like <i>Banjo-Kazooie</i>, <i>Super Mario 64</i>, <i>Super Mario Galaxy</i>, and modern hits like <i>A Hat in Time</i>. Take control of <strong>Chilly</strong>, a goofy, ice-obsessed penguin, and his sarcastic hedgehog companion <strong>Spiny</strong>, as they set off on a whimsical journey to recover the stolen ice blocks from the evil Polar Bear King.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant, themed worlds packed with secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master satisfying movement mechanics like wall jumps, double jumps, sliding, and surfing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with gameplay elements like bounce platforms, gravity shifts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect tons of unique items\u2014especially the precious <strong>ice blocks</strong> scattered throughout each level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Worlds to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Spiny &amp; Chilly as they venture through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meteor-crashed valley turned mining colony run by mole engineers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted harbor plagued by ghost ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A floating island inhabited by brilliant bird scientists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is handcrafted with its own theme, challenges, and quirky characters.</p>",
    "short_description": "A quirky 3D platformer collectathon where a penguin and his hedgehog buddy explore vibrant worlds to recover stolen ice blocks. Inspired by classics like Banjo-Kazooie and Mario 64.",
